Package: reflowR
Title: Themed Extensions for Workflowr Research Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Raban", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Extends the workflowr package with themed color schemes, structured
    analysis pipeline templates, and utility scripts for reproducible research.
    Wraps workflowr::wflow_start() and adds five color schemes (clinical, basic
    research, code/statistics, special, and neutral), three depth presets for the
    Rmd pipeline (minimal, standard, extended), custom CSS/SCSS theming, SVG
    icons, ggplot2 theme functions, and a Quarto report template. All generated
    projects remain fully compatible with standard workflowr commands.
